            "notes": "The blue/green items for weapon power and speed can be mixed and matched depending on what you can afford.  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) + [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is the ideal blue item combo at this stage, but if you can't afford it or need to prioritize surviving with [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016), aim for a mix of weapon power and weapon speed (taking into account [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e)'s near constantly proc'd weapon speed boost that won't be reflected in your stats), since they stack multiplicatively.\n\nIn other words, 10 WP + 10 WS will output more healing than 20 WP + 0 WS.",
