            "notes": "Lots of options at this stage, and what to choose will be highly situational.\n\n[Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) is a good general pick.\n\nIf the match even made it to round 7, things might not be going as smoothly. [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) if you haven't taken it before this point is a good defensive pick.\n\nYou can go [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) + [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) if you feel like pulling off sneaky rezzes is going to bring you value. Or just for fun. I'm not your boss.",
